  <releases>
    <release version="0.8.12" date="2026-10-06">
      <description><p>Restore automatic episode continuation and immediate Continue Watching and Next Up updates. Decode full-resolution YUV seek previews directly and scale them on the GPU with interface-relative sizing. Start on Home and offer explicit watching-profile selection. Restore ordinary library drag scrolling with menu-based move, hide and restore controls. Fix Plex media metadata, saved sign-in and playback-queue synchronization. Include the native spoolet control and screenshot utility.</p></description>
    </release>
    <release version="0.8.11" date="2026-10-01">
      <description><p>Rearrange homepage libraries by dragging or with TV-remote move controls. Improve PIN, password and Quick Connect screens. Show clearer server labels and source icons, and deduplicate search results across servers. Bundle updated Jellyfin, Emby and Plex providers, which remain independently upgradable. Update FFmpeg to its security-fixed bugfix release.</p></description>
    </release>
    <release version="0.8.3" date="2026-09-29">
      <description><p>Install and update providers from the startup chooser with download progress, and enable optional provider features.</p></description>
    </release>
